Alto first-person ride: material-detail textures (alto-tex0.png, alto-tex1.png)

These two 512x512 PNGs are original procedural work generated by alto/build/palace_tex_bake.py
(periodic value noise and cellular noise, computed in a headless browser). They contain no
third-party images, so no third-party licence applies; they are distributed under the same terms
as the rest of Alto (see LICENSE at the repository root).

Channels (each a grey detail map normalised to mean 0.5):
  alto-tex0.png  R asphalt   G concrete   B roof gravel
  alto-tex1.png  R brick face   G limestone   B wall grime streaks

Photographic CC0 replacements (planned, not yet fetched; ambientCG, CC0 1.0 per https://docs.ambientcg.com/license/):
  Asphalt, PavingStones/Concrete, Bricks (two red), a limestone/rock wall, Gravel/roofing.
Before any is added here, record for each: the asset page URL, its licence as stated on that page,
the download date, and the conversion (crop/scale to 512 px, converted to grey detail or albedo).
